  I have just started the most amazing game of nethack.  I was a wizard, and
I had a nice array of starting equipment: ring of conflict and a ring of
invisible.  I quaffed the potion of gain ability that I had, and lo and 
behold, out jumped a djinni who proceeded to give me a wish.  I wished for a
pair of gauntlets of power, as I like being able to carry around five different
suits of armour.
  Next thing I did was to drink from the fountain in the room.  A water daemon
appeared, and gave another wish!  With my jaw hanging open, I asked for a pair
of speed boots. 
  After wandering around the first level, I came across an iron wand.  I tried
the engraving trick to try and identify it.  Imagine my surprise when it 
turned out to be a wand of wishing.  I wished for a blessed tinning kit.
  Now this wand probably has at least two more charges on it, so my question
is, what should I wish for?  I would appreciate it if someone would send me
a list of the best items, or combinations of items.  
  Also, I have considered wishing for a ring of polymorph control and a wand
of polymorph.  Should I also get one of those rings that protects me agains
dying of system shock?  What monsters should I turn into that lay eggs that I
can eat?  I know about the black dragon, but are there any more?
  Any help would be greatly appreciated.


